{"id":"1cb07a207dad8bbd","group":"56","path":"56/56-ex-addition-termination-modulo-ac.md","title":"ex-addition-termination-modulo-ac","display":"ex-addition-termination-modulo-ac","type":"example","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"example","label":"56-ex-addition-termination-modulo-ac","aliases":["56-ex-addition-termination-modulo-ac"],"display":"ex-addition-termination-modulo-ac","depends_on":["[[56-df-polynomial-interpretation]]","[[56-thm-interpretation-termination-modulo-equations]]"],"source_section":"6.2.16","source_pages":"194–195","source_ocr_blocks":[215,216],"source_statement_status":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr","source_proof_status":"local-algebraic-calculation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"label","html":"56-ex-addition-termination-modulo-ac"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-ex-addition-termination-modulo-ac</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-addition-termination-modulo-ac"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1fcf344733aab173\" href=\"?note=1fcf344733aab173\" title=\"56-df-polynomial-interpretation\">56-df-polynomial-interpretation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a7b1b75a0e18bc22\" href=\"?note=a7b1b75a0e18bc22\" title=\"56-thm-interpretation-termination-modulo-equations\">56-thm-interpretation-termination-modulo-equations</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"6.2.16"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"194–195"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>215</span><span>216</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"local-algebraic-calculation"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=\\{\\mathbf0,s,+\\}\">\\(F=\\{\\mathbf0,s,+\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ar}(\\mathbf0)=0\">\\(\\mathrm{ar}(\\mathbf0)=0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ar}(s)=1\">\\(\\mathrm{ar}(s)=1\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ar}(+)=2\">\\(\\mathrm{ar}(+)=2\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,z\\in V\">\\(x,y,z\\in V\\)</span> 互异，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_2=\\{a\\in\\mathbb N\\mid a\\ge2\\}\">\\(A_2=\\{a\\in\\mathbb N\\mid a\\ge2\\}\\)</span>，多项式输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(X,Y\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+\">\\(+\\)</span> 的结合性和交换性放在等式集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_{\\mathrm{add}}\">\\(R_{\\mathrm{add}}\\)</span> 只含计算规则。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nR_{\\mathrm{add}}&amp;:=\\{(+(\\mathbf0,x),x),\\;(+(s(x),y),s(+(x,y)))\\},\\\\\nE_{\\mathrm{AC}}&amp;:=\\{(+(x,y),+(y,x)),\\;(+(+(x,y),z),+(x,+(y,z)))\\},\\\\\nP_{\\mathbf0}()&amp;:=2,\\qquad P_s(X):=X+1,\\qquad P_+(X,Y):=XY,\\\\\n\\mathrm{PolyInt}_\\Sigma(P)&amp;\\land\\mathrm{EqModels}_\\Sigma(A_2,I_P,E_{\\mathrm{AC}})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Compatible}(R_{\\mathrm{add}},&gt;_{(A_2,I_P,&gt;\\restriction A_2^2)}^{\\Sigma,V})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Terminating}(T,\\to_{R_{\\mathrm{add}}/E_{\\mathrm{AC}}}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nR_{\\mathrm{add}}&amp;:=\\{(+(\\mathbf0,x),x),\\;(+(s(x),y),s(+(x,y)))\\},\\\\\nE_{\\mathrm{AC}}&amp;:=\\{(+(x,y),+(y,x)),\\;(+(+(x,y),z),+(x,+(y,z)))\\},\\\\\nP_{\\mathbf0}()&amp;:=2,\\qquad P_s(X):=X+1,\\qquad P_+(X,Y):=XY,\\\\\n\\mathrm{PolyInt}_\\Sigma(P)&amp;\\land\\mathrm{EqModels}_\\Sigma(A_2,I_P,E_{\\mathrm{AC}})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Compatible}(R_{\\mathrm{add}},&gt;_{(A_2,I_P,&gt;\\restriction A_2^2)}^{\\Sigma,V})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Terminating}(T,\\to_{R_{\\mathrm{add}}/E_{\\mathrm{AC}}}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Example 6.2.16。解释乘法 XY 满足结合和交换；两条计算规则的解释差值为 X 与 Y−1，在 A₂ 上严格正。该例说明为何 AC 等式应保留在模等价层：将交换等式任意单向写作计算规则会产生自反或双向改写链。已逐项重算运算单调性、两项差值及 AC 恒等式。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>, Cambridge University Press, 2003；6.2.16，印刷页 194–195。<code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 是本地 DjVu 文本提取块序号，不是已确认的物理扫描页号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-polynomial-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"1fcf344733aab173","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-polynomial-interpretation]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-interpretation-termination-modulo-equations","status":"resolved","id":"a7b1b75a0e18bc22","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-interpretation-termination-modulo-equations]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})","display":false},{"tex":"F=\\{\\mathbf0,s,+\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ar}(\\mathbf0)=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ar}(s)=1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ar}(+)=2","display":false},{"tex":"x,y,z\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)","display":false},{"tex":"A_2=\\{a\\in\\mathbb N\\mid a\\ge2\\}","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y\\in\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"+","display":false},{"tex":"R_{\\mathrm{add}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nR_{\\mathrm{add}}&:=\\{(+(\\mathbf0,x),x),\\;(+(s(x),y),s(+(x,y)))\\},\\\\\nE_{\\mathrm{AC}}&:=\\{(+(x,y),+(y,x)),\\;(+(+(x,y),z),+(x,+(y,z)))\\},\\\\\nP_{\\mathbf0}()&:=2,\\qquad P_s(X):=X+1,\\qquad P_+(X,Y):=XY,\\\\\n\\mathrm{PolyInt}_\\Sigma(P)&\\land\\mathrm{EqModels}_\\Sigma(A_2,I_P,E_{\\mathrm{AC}})\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Compatible}(R_{\\mathrm{add}},>_{(A_2,I_P,>\\restriction A_2^2)}^{\\Sigma,V})\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Terminating}(T,\\to_{R_{\\mathrm{add}}/E_{\\mathrm{AC}}}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1976,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-233","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-ex-addition-termination-modulo-ac.md]]"}],"outgoing":["1fcf344733aab173","a7b1b75a0e18bc22"]}